{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32232","headline":"奉天西佛寺 · 温庭筠","name":"奉天西佛寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔狂童犯顺年，玉虬闲暇出甘泉。\n宗臣欲舞千钧劒，追骑犹观七宝鞭。\n星背紫垣终埽地，日归黄道却当天。\n至今南顿诸耆旧，犹指榛芜作弄田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}